/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, Madison County has 75 years on record, 1951 to 2025. On the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, March to April, May to June, July to August and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 33 of those years. In 2025 on the middle, May to June ran 166% of normal and August to September ran 79%. Grid 27518 had its driest year in 1964 at 73%.</p>"}
